WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.204
Once upon a time there was a young wizard.

2
00:00:11.205 --> 00:00:14.699
His name was Tom.

3
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:20.140
Tom studied hard at wizard school.

4
00:00:20.141 --> 00:00:27.147
But he was not good at magic.

5
00:00:27.148 --> 00:00:37.751
"Tom, turn me into a tree," said Master Wizard.

6
00:00:37.752 --> 00:00:46.171
Tom waved his wand. Poof!

7
00:00:46.172 --> 00:00:57.145
Master Wizard turned into a bee!

8
00:00:57.146 --> 00:01:04.874
The other wizards laughed.

9
00:01:04.875 --> 00:01:09.885
Master Wizard sighed.

10
00:01:09.886 --> 00:01:13.382
"Tell me again, Tom.

11
00:01:13.383 --> 00:01:17.293
Why do you want to be a wizard?"

12
00:01:17.294 --> 00:01:23.433
"I want to use magic to help people," said Tom.

13
00:01:23.434 --> 00:01:28.759
"That's a fine wish, Tom," said Master.

14
00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:42.136
"But you must practice—a lot!"

15
00:01:42.137 --> 00:01:53.457
One day a trumpet blared.

16
00:01:53.458 --> 00:02:07.837
It was a messenger from the palace!

17
00:02:07.838 --> 00:02:11.846
"Hear this!" cried the messenger.

18
00:02:11.847 --> 00:02:17.544
"The king needs a new royal wizard.

19
00:02:17.545 --> 00:02:24.049
This school may send one student to try out."

20
00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:28.556
"Maybe I can try out," thought Tom.

21
00:02:28.557 --> 00:02:39.362
"I could use magic to help the whole kingdom!"

22
00:02:39.363 --> 00:02:44.907
Later Tom found Master Wizard.

23
00:02:44.908 --> 00:02:49.641
"Master, may I try out?" Tom asked.

24
00:02:49.642 --> 00:02:56.429
The other wizards laughed.

25
00:02:56.430 --> 00:03:01.929
"You can't be the royal wizard," said Walter.

26
00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:05.747
"You're no good at magic!"

27
00:03:05.748 --> 00:03:10.719
"We'll see, Tom," Master said kindly.

28
00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:13.331
"Hooray!" Tom cheered.

29
00:03:13.332 --> 00:03:20.329
He waved his wand by mistake. Poof!

30
00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:25.958
"You fool!" Walter cried.

31
00:03:25.959 --> 00:03:28.578
Tom looked up.

32
00:03:28.579 --> 00:03:32.535
The ceiling had a big hole.

33
00:03:32.536 --> 00:03:42.936
"Oops!" said Tom.

